u9n = u6x + RISK_GATHER (an existing switch, never on the replica; trap doctrine for the economy's rats). u6x drops
the trap-risk mask (TrapRisk: avoid tiles within Chebyshev 1 of an enemy baby's front tiles seen in the last 150
rounds, where its rat traps can lie) for every rat while an enemy is within dist2 20. With RISK_GATHER a gatherer keeps
the mask while engaged, unless it is hunting (prey within dist2 8: HUNT_IGNORES_RISK). Fighters and attackers are
unchanged, so the bites and grabs the earlier fight-time masks gave up stay (t0b RISK_FRESH, u0u RISK_ADAPT, s8h
RISK_IN_FIGHT, u1l FACE_HOLD, u1n WOUNDED_HP: fewer kills, trap fires on us did not fall).
